n’s release from jail and mobilise people for the supremacy of the Constitution.In an order dated Sept 20, a copy of which is available withDawn, the Lahore DC Office ordered that Noreen and Uzma be detained for 30 days under the Punjab Maintenance of Public Order Ordinance, 1960, stating that the two were “prejudicial to the public safety and maintenance of public order”.The MPO ordinance allows the authorities to order detention and restrict judicial review of such orders.The ...", "published_at": "2026-09-21T14:56:53+00:00", "image_url": "https://i.dawn.com/large/2026/09/21080823b452561.webp", "source": {"name": "Dawn", "tier": "international", "url": "https://www.dawn.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 48, "sensationalism": 9, "opinion_fact": 16, "factual_rigor": 71, "framing": 18, "confidence": 0.71, "rationale": {"lean": {"keyword_score": 47.5, "framing_shift": 0.0, "entity_shift": 0.0, "sentence_direction": 0.0, "text_score": 47.5, "source_baseline": 50, "text_shift": -2.5, "delta_max": 24, "confidence": 1.0, "top_left_keywords": ["occupy", "fascism"], "top_right_keywords": ["law and order"], "framing_phrases_found": [], "entity_sentiments": {}, "state_affiliated": false, "unscored": false}, "sensationalism": {"headline_score": 1.2, "body_score": 6.5, "clickbait_signals": 0, "superlative_density": 0.12, "urgency_density": 0.0, "hyperbole_density": 0.0, "measured_density": 0.12, "partisan_attack_density": 0.0}, "opinion": {"pronoun_score": 13.2, "subjectivity_score": 29.0, "modal_score": 2.4, "hedging_score": 1.5, "attribution_score": 17.7, "metadata_score": 0.0, "value_judgment_score": 100.0, "absolutist_assertion_score": 0.0, "classification": "Reporting", "dominant_signals": ["value_judgments", "subjectivity", "attribution_gaps"]}, "coverage": {"named_sources_count": 35, "org_citations_count": 8, "data_points_count": 0, "direct_quotes_count": 40, "vague_sources_count": 0, "specificity_ratio": 1.0}, "framing": {"connotation_score": 22.1, "keyword_emph